# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the CPU, memory, and GPU resources for a managed workflow, and define sizes that match the size of the problem."
msgstr "Vyber zdroje CPU, paměti a GPU pro spravovaný workflow a definuj velikosti, které odpovídají velikosti problému."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a compute profile"
msgstr "Vyber výpočetní profil"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a compute profile {#choose-a-compute-profile}"
msgstr "Vyber výpočetní profil {#choose-a-compute-profile}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows run on compute profiles. A compute profile is a fixed combination of vCPUs, memory, and GPUs, similar to the resources that you request from an HPC scheduler. When you upload a workflow, you map its sizes, such as `S` and `M`, to profiles, and each run picks one of those sizes. The job then runs on its own node with that profile, and keeps the profile until the job ends.\n"
msgstr "Spravované workflow běží na výpočetních profilech. Výpočetní profil je pevná kombinace vCPU, paměti a GPU, podobná zdrojům, které žádáš od plánovače HPC. Když nahraješ workflow, namapuješ jeho velikosti, například `S` a `M`, na profily a každý běh si vybere jednu z těchto velikostí. Úloha pak běží na vlastním uzlu s tímto profilem a profil si ponechá, dokud úloha neskončí.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Profile | vCPUs | Memory (GB) | GPUs |\n"
"| - | - | - | - |\n"
"| `8x32` | 8 | 32 | None |\n"
"| `16x128` | 16 | 128 | None |\n"
"| `48x768` | 48 | 768 | None |\n"
"| `128x1500` | 128 | 1500 | None |\n"
"| `24x120x1l40s` | 24 | 120 | 1 L40S |\n"
"| `20x320x2a100` | 20 | 320 | 2 A100 |\n"
"| `80x1200x8a100` | 80 | 1200 | 8 A100 |\n"
"| `160x1792x8h100` | 160 | 1792 | 8 H100 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Profil | vCPU | Paměť (GB) | GPU |\n"
"| - | - | - | - |\n"
"| `8x32` | 8 | 32 | Žádné |\n"
"| `16x128` | 16 | 128 | Žádné |\n"
"| `48x768` | 48 | 768 | Žádné |\n"
"| `128x1500` | 128 | 1500 | Žádné |\n"
"| `24x120x1l40s` | 24 | 120 | 1 L40S |\n"
"| `20x320x2a100` | 20 | 320 | 2 A100 |\n"
"| `80x1200x8a100` | 80 | 1200 | 8 A100 |\n"
"| `160x1792x8h100` | 160 | 1792 | 8 H100 |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A profile ID has the form `{cpu}x{memory}`, with memory in GB, or `{cpu}x{memory}x{count}{gpu}` for a profile with GPUs. For example, `24x120x1l40s` has 24 vCPUs, 120 GB of memory, and one NVIDIA L40S GPU.\n"
msgstr "ID profilu má tvar `{cpu}x{memory}`, kde paměť je v GB, nebo `{cpu}x{memory}x{count}{gpu}` u profilu s GPU. Například `24x120x1l40s` má 24 vCPU, 120 GB paměti a jednu GPU NVIDIA L40S.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check available profiles {#check-available-profiles}"
msgstr "Zkontroluj dostupné profily {#check-available-profiles}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
